<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Privacy Policy — Classic Academy</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">

  <!-- SEO -->
  <meta name="description" content="How Classic Academy collects, uses, protects, retains, and discloses personal information, including Google Calendar data used for optional booking features." />
  <meta name="robots" content="index,follow,max-snippet:-1,max-image-preview:large,max-video-preview:-1" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#4a90e2" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.classicacademy.app/privacy" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="Privacy Policy — Classic Academy" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="How Classic Academy collects, uses, protects, retains, and discloses personal information, including Google Calendar data used for optional booking features." />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.classicacademy.app/privacy" />
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://www.classicacademy.app/assets/og/classic-academy.jpg" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="Privacy Policy — Classic Academy" />
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="How Classic Academy collects, uses, protects, retains, and discloses personal information, including Google Calendar data used for optional booking features." />
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.classicacademy.app/assets/og/classic-academy.jpg" />

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/icon?family=Material+Icons" rel="stylesheet">

  <style nonce="<%= cspNonce %>">
    :root {
      --primary: #4a90e2;
      --accent: #d97800;
      --highlight: #009f8b;

      --ink: #0f172a;
      --muted: #475569;

      --page-pad: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 6rem);
      --radius: 22px;

      --shadow2: 0 18px 50px rgba(15, 23, 42, .12);
      --shadow3: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, .10);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      background: #e0f7fa;
      color: #333;
      overflow-x: clip;
      padding-top: 112px;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      body {
        padding-top: 102px;
      }
    }

    a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
    }

    /* Loader */
    #loader {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: #e0f7fa;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      z-index: 9999;
      padding: 1.2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .academylogo {
      width: min(220px, 70vw);
    }

    .academylogo img {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
    }

    .loader {
      position: relative;
      width: 18px;
      height: 28px;
      perspective: 500px;
      animation: flip 2s infinite;
    }

    .loader:nth-child(2) {
      animation-delay: .2s;
    }

    .loader:nth-child(3) {
      animation-delay: .4s;
    }

    .loader:nth-child(4) {
      animation-delay: .6s;
    }

    .loader:nth-child(5) {
      animation-delay: .8s;
    }

    .face {
      position: absolute;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      backface-visibility: hidden;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .front {
      background: var(--primary);
    }

    .back {
      background: #d35400;
      transform: rotateY(180deg);
    }

    @keyframes flip {

      0%,
      100% {
        transform: rotateY(0deg);
      }

      50% {
        transform: rotateY(180deg);
      }
    }

    /* NAVBAR */
    .header {
      position: fixed;
      top: 14px;
      left: var(--page-pad);
      right: var(--page-pad);
      padding: .65rem .85rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .70);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .78);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 46px rgba(15, 23, 42, .10);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: .8rem;
      z-index: 2000;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .75rem;
      min-width: 0;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .brand-mark {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, .10);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .85);
      flex: 0 0 auto;
    }

    .brand-txt {
      display: grid;
      line-height: 1.05;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .brand-name {
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -.02em;
      color: var(--ink);
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }

    .brand-sub {
      font-size: .86rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }

    .navbar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .35rem;
    }

    .navbar a {
      padding: .55rem .75rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: #1d4ed8;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1.02rem;
      transition: background .2s ease, transform .2s ease, color .2s ease;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .navbar a:hover {
      background: rgba(74, 144, 226, .10);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .nav-pill {
      border: 1px solid rgba(74, 144, 226, .35);
      background: rgba(74, 144, 226, .10);
      color: #0f172a !important;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .nav-pill:hover {
      background: rgba(74, 144, 226, .18);
      border-color: rgba(74, 144, 226, .45);
    }

    .nav-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .55rem;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: .45rem;
      padding: 0.72rem 1rem;
      background-color: var(--primary);
      color: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--primary);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-weight: 800;
      transition: background-color .25s ease, transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
      user-select: none;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(74, 144, 226, .18);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background-color: transparent;
      color: var(--primary);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(15, 23, 42, .12);
    }

    .btn.ghost {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .72);
      border: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, .12);
      color: var(--ink);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(15, 23, 42, .08);
    }

    .btn.ghost:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .88);
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .btn-sm {
      padding: .55rem .8rem !important;
      font-size: .95rem !important;
      box-shadow: none !important;
    }

    .menu-btn {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, .12);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .78);
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(15, 23, 42, .08);
    }

    .menu-btn i {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .brand-sub {
        display: none;
      }

      .menu-btn {
        display: inline-flex;
      }

      .navbar {
        position: absolute;
        top: calc(100% + .65rem);
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        margin: 0 .25rem;
        padding: .75rem;
        background: rgba(74, 144, 226, .96);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .35);
        border-radius: 20px;
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        display: grid;
        gap: .4rem;
        transform: translateY(-8px);
        opacity: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        transition: transform .2s ease, opacity .2s ease;
      }

      .navbar.active {
        transform: translateY(0);
        opacity: 1;
        pointer-events: auto;
      }

      .navbar a {
        color: #fff;
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: .85rem .85rem;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .08);
      }

      .navbar a:hover {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .14);
        transform: none;
        color: #fff;
      }

      .nav-pill {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .18);
        border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .35);
        color: #fff !important;
      }
    }

    /* Footer */
    .footer {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.30);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-radius: 25px;
      margin: 2rem var(--page-pad);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .footer div {
      margin: 1rem;
      flex: 1 1 200px;
    }

    .footer h4 {
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .footer ul {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .footer ul li {
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .footer ul li a {
      color: #333;
    }

    .footer ul li a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    /* Scroll to Top */
    #toTopBtn {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 30px;
      right: 30px;
      background-color: var(--primary);
      color: white;
      border: none;
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      display: none;
      z-index: 1000;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }

    #toTopBtn:hover {
      transform: scale(1.08);
    }

    /* Floating support button */
    .fab-container {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      align-items: center;
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 170px;
      right: 20px;
      z-index: 999;
    }

    .whatsapp-icon {
      transition: fill 0.3s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .whatsapp-icon:hover {
      fill: white;
    }

    .fab-container:hover {
      height: 100%;
    }

    .fab-container:hover .sub-button:nth-child(2) {
      transform: translateY(-80px);
    }

    .fab-container:hover .sub-button:nth-child(3) {
      transform: translateY(-140px);
    }

    .fab-container:hover .sub-button:nth-child(4) {
      transform: translateY(-200px);
    }

    .fab-container .sub-button {
      position: absolute;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      bottom: 10px;
      right: 10px;
      height: 50px;
      width: 50px;
      background-color: #4ba2ff;
      border-radius: 50%;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .fab-container .sub-button .material-icons {
      color: #2e2e2e;
      padding-top: 6px;
    }

    .fab-container .sub-button .material-icons:hover {
      color: #FEFEFE;
    }

    .fab-container .fab {
      position: relative;
      height: 70px;
      width: 70px;
      background-color: #4ba2ff;
      border-radius: 50%;
      z-index: 2;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(15, 23, 42, .10);
    }

    .fab-container .fab:before {
      content: " ";
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 35px;
      width: 35px;
      background-color: inherit;
      border-radius: 0 0 10px 0;
      z-index: -1;
    }

    .fab-container .fab .fab-content {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      height: 100%;
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 50%;
      cursor: pointer;
      user-select: none;
    }

    .fab-container .fab .fab-content .material-icons {
      color: #2e2e2e;
      font-size: 48px;
    }

    /* reveal helper */
    .reveal {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(14px);
      transition: all .7s ease;
    }

    .reveal.in {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      html {
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
      }

      .reveal {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: none;
        transition: none;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .fab-container {
        bottom: 180px;
      }

      .footer h4 {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
      }
    }

    main.page {
      padding: 0 var(--page-pad);
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1500px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 1.25rem 0 2.25rem;
    }

    .hero {
      border-radius: calc(var(--radius) + 6px);
      overflow: hidden;
      background:
        radial-gradient(900px 420px at 10% 15%, rgba(74, 144, 226, .20), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(760px 420px at 90% 0%, rgba(217, 120, 0, .14), transparent 58%),
        radial-gradient(760px 520px at 80% 110%, rgba(0, 159, 139, .12), transparent 56%),
        rgba(255, 255, 255, .40);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .70);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow2);
      padding: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);
    }

    .kicker {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .55rem;
      padding: .45rem .75rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .65);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .8);
      color: #1b2a4e;
      font-weight: 800;
      width: fit-content;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(15, 23, 42, .08);
    }

    .hero h1 {
      margin: .9rem 0 .4rem;
      font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 2.55vw, 2.45rem);
      line-height: 1.15;
      letter-spacing: -.02em;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .hero p {
      margin: .5rem 0 0;
      color: #24324f;
      font-size: 1.02rem;
      max-width: 72ch;
    }

    .hero .actions {
      margin-top: 1rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: .6rem;
    }

    .note {
      margin-top: .9rem;
      font-size: .95rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .grid {
      margin-top: 1.1rem;
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .78);
      border: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, .08);
      border-radius: 22px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow3);
      padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    }

    .card h2 {
      margin: .15rem 0 .5rem;
      color: var(--ink);
      letter-spacing: -.01em;
    }

    .card p {
      margin: 0.35rem 0;
      color: #334155;
    }

    .card ul {
      margin: .55rem 0 0;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
      display: grid;
      gap: .55rem;
    }

    .card li {
      display: flex;
      gap: .6rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .card li i {
      color: #16a34a;
      margin-top: .25rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .hero .actions {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }

      .hero .actions .btn {
        width: 100%;
        padding: .62rem .7rem;
        font-size: .95rem;
        box-shadow: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/classic-motion.css">
</head>

<body>
  <div id="loader">
    <div class="academylogo">
      <img src="/img/academylogo.png" alt="Classic Academy logo">
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex; gap:10px;">
      <div class="loader">
        <div class="face front"></div>
        <div class="face back"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="loader">
        <div class="face front"></div>
        <div class="face back"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="loader">
        <div class="face front"></div>
        <div class="face back"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="loader">
        <div class="face front"></div>
        <div class="face back"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="loader">
        <div class="face front"></div>
        <div class="face back"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Nav -->
  <header class="header" id="siteHeader">
    <a href="/" class="brand" aria-label="Classic Academy Home">
      <img class="brand-mark" src="/img/academylogo.png" alt="Classic Academy logo">
      <div class="brand-txt">
        <span class="brand-name">Classic Academy</span>
        <span class="brand-sub">School management + admissions</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <nav class="navbar" aria-label="Primary" id="primaryNav">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="/about">About</a>
      <a href="/services">Features</a>
      <a href="/#testimonials">Benefits</a>
      <a href="/#contact">Contact</a>
      <a class="nav-pill" href="/#pricing">Join Today</a>
      <a class="nav-pill" href="/schedule">Sign In</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="nav-actions">
      <a href="/schedule" class="btn btn-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check"></i> Book Demo</a>
      <button id="menu-btn" class="menu-btn" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-bars"></i>
      </button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="page" aria-label="Privacy policy">
    <div class="container">
      <section class="hero reveal">
        <div class="kicker"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> Privacy • Data handling • Security</div>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>This Privacy Policy explains how Classic Academy collects, uses, stores, protects, retains, deletes, and discloses Personal Data when You use the Classic Academy school-management platform, public website, demo-booking service, and related services.</p>
        <p>Classic Academy is a product operated by Mabur Technologies, trading as Classic Technologies. This policy applies specifically to Classic Academy at <strong>https://www.classicacademy.app</strong> and includes a dedicated disclosure explaining Classic Academy's use of Google Calendar and Google API data for optional booking functionality.</p>
        <p>We use Personal Data only for the purposes described in this Privacy Policy and, where required by applicable law, only where We have a valid legal basis to do so, including Your consent where consent is required.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-sm" href="/contact"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i> Contact</a>
          <a class="btn ghost btn-sm" href="/terms"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-contract"></i> Terms</a>
        </div>
        <p class="note">Last updated: <span id="lastUpdated" data-fixed="true">September 06, 2026</span></p>
      </section>

      <section class="grid" aria-label="Policy sections">
        <article class="card reveal">
          <h2>Interpretation and Definitions</h2>
          
        </article>

        <article class="card reveal">
          <h2>Interpretation</h2>
          <p>The words whose initial letters are capitalized have meanings defined under the following conditions. The following definitions shall have the same meaning regardless of whether they appear in singular or in plural.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card reveal">
          <h2>Definitions</h2>
          <p>For the purposes of this Privacy Policy:</p>
          <ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Account</strong> means a unique account created for You to access Our Service or parts of Our Service.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Affiliate</strong> means an entity that controls, is controlled by, or is under common control with a party, where "control" means ownership of 50% or more of the shares, equity interest or other securities entitled to vote for election of directors or other managing authority.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Company</strong> (referred to as "the Company", "We", "Us" or "Our") means Mabur Technologies, trading as Classic Technologies, as the operator of the Classic Academy product and service.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Cookies</strong> are small files that are placed on Your computer, mobile device or any other device by a website, containing the details of Your browsing history on that website, among its many uses.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Country/State</strong> refers to: Uganda.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Device</strong> means any device that can access the Service, such as a computer, a cell phone or a digital tablet.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Personal Data</strong> (or "Personal Information") is any information that relates to an identified or identifiable individual.</p>
<p>We use "Personal Data" and "Personal Information" interchangeably unless a law uses a specific term.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Service</strong> means the Classic Academy school-management platform, public website, demo-booking service, tenant school services, and related features made available through Classic Academy.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Service Provider</strong> means any natural or legal person who processes the data on behalf of the Company. It refers to third-party companies or individuals employed by the Company to facilitate the Service, to provide the Service on behalf of the Company, to perform services related to the Service or to assist the Company in analyzing how the Service is used.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Usage Data</strong> refers to data collected automatically, either generated by the use of the Service or from the Service infrastructure itself (for example, the duration of a page visit).</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>User</strong> means any individual who accesses or uses the Service.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Website</strong> refers to Classic Academy, accessible from <a href="https://www.classicacademy.app" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">https://www.classicacademy.app </a>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>You</strong> means the individual accessing or using the Service, or the company, or other legal entity on behalf of which such individual is accessing or using the Service, as applicable.</p>
</li>
</ul>
        </article>

        <article class="card reveal">
          <h2>Collecting and Using Your Personal Information</h2>
          
        </article>

        <article class="card reveal">
          <h2>Types of Data Collected</h2>
          <p>Classic Academy is a school-management platform. The categories of Personal Data We process depend on the features used by a school, applicant, student, parent or guardian, staff member, administrator, visitor, or booking user. We may process the following categories:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Identity and contact data:</strong> names, email addresses, phone numbers, postal or residential addresses, nationality, gender, dates of birth, profile photographs, and other contact or identity information supplied to the Service.</li>
            <li><strong>Account and access data:</strong> user identifiers, school or organization membership, role and permission information, authentication and session information, invitation or account-recovery information, and records used to secure access to the Service.</li>
            <li><strong>Student and guardian data:</strong> student or registration numbers, class, stream, section, campus, school level, academic year and term, guardian names and contact information, enrollment status, hold or suspension status, and related student administration records.</li>
            <li><strong>Admissions, scholarship and application data:</strong> application identifiers, educational history, qualifications, grades, program or class choices, application status, review information, supporting documents, offer information, scholarship applications, and related correspondence.</li>
            <li><strong>Academic and learning data:</strong> subjects, classes, attendance, assessments, examinations, results, grades, assignments, submissions, transcripts, timetables, academic events, course registrations, promotion history, and related academic records.</li>
            <li><strong>Student welfare and school-life data:</strong> discipline records, hostel applications or allocations, transport assignments, library borrowing/reservations/fines, event registrations, and other school-operational records where a school enables those modules.</li>
            <li><strong>Fees, finance and transaction data:</strong> fee structures, invoices, balances, payment amounts, payment methods, receipt or transaction references, payment status, refunds or voids, and other school finance records. Classic Academy does not intentionally store complete payment-card numbers, CVV/CVC values, or mobile-money PINs.</li>
            <li><strong>Staff and employment-related data:</strong> staff profiles, departments, roles, work status, leave information, payroll-related records, permissions, and operational records entered by or for a participating school.</li>
            <li><strong>Communications and support data:</strong> messages, announcements, notifications, support tickets, inquiries, reviews, email/SMS delivery information, and communications sent through or about the Service.</li>
            <li><strong>Files and documents:</strong> documents, photographs, reports, statements, application files, student documents, and other files uploaded or generated through enabled platform features.</li>
            <li><strong>Booking and integration data:</strong> demo/support booking details, requested dates and times, attendee contact information, meeting links and identifiers, and data required by optional integrations such as Google Calendar and Zoom. Google user data is described separately below.</li>
            <li><strong>Usage, device and security data:</strong> IP address, browser and device information, operating system, pages or features used, timestamps, diagnostic information, security events, audit records, and similar logs used to operate, secure and troubleshoot the Service.</li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>Tracking Technologies and Cookies.</strong> We use necessary session cookies and, where applicable and legally permitted, functionality or analytics technologies to keep users signed in, remember preferences, protect accounts, understand Service performance, and improve the Service. Where consent is required for non-essential technologies, We request that consent before using them. Users can also control cookies through their browser settings.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card reveal">
          <h2>School and Education Data Responsibilities</h2>
          <p>Participating schools use Classic Academy to manage their own institutional records. For school-controlled records, the participating school determines the educational and administrative purposes for which those records are processed and decides which authorized staff, parents, guardians, students, or other users may access them. Classic Academy processes those records to provide the platform features requested by the school, protect the Service, provide support, create backups where configured, and meet applicable legal obligations.</p>
          <p>Because Classic Academy can be used by nursery, primary, secondary, tertiary or other education providers, school-controlled records may include information about children and other minors. Access to those records is restricted through school-controlled accounts, roles and permissions, subject to the school's own legal and consent responsibilities.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card reveal">
