</li>
</ul>
          <p><strong>Important Google User Data limitation:</strong> The general marketing, analytics, affiliate, business-transfer, and "other purposes" language in this section does <strong>not</strong> expand how Classic Academy may use Google user data. Google user data is governed by the dedicated "Google User Data — Access, Use, Storage, Sharing and Deletion" section below and is used only to provide or improve the user-facing Google Calendar booking functionality described there.</p>
          <p><strong>How We share Personal Data.</strong> We disclose Personal Data only as necessary for the purposes described in this Privacy Policy:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Participating schools and authorized users:</strong> school-controlled records are available to the school and to users whom the school authorizes according to their roles and permissions.</li>
