        <article class="card reveal">
          <h2>Security of Your Personal Data</h2>
          <p>The security of Your Personal Data is important to Us. We use administrative and technical safeguards appropriate to the Service, including access controls, secure server-side handling of integration credentials, HTTPS/TLS for production traffic, and encryption of stored Google OAuth refresh credentials. No method of transmission over the Internet or electronic storage is 100% secure, so We cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
